[[12,1,0,"<h2>STRUCTURE</h2><p>The engine lubrication system is shown below.</p><figure class=\"photo\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/33994.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"><ul class=\"legend\"><li>1 - Suction head with filter mesh</li><li>2 - Oil pump</li><li>3 - Oil filter cartridge</li><li>4 - Engine oil heat exchanger</li><li>5 - Main longitudinal channel</li><li>6 - Jets (piston skirt cooling)</li><li>7 - Vertical channel (camshaft mounting - right head lubrication)</li><li>8 - Vertical channel (camshaft mounting - left head lubrication)</li><li>9 - Oil falling back into sump</li><li>10 - Switch for engine oil pressure warning light</li><li>11 - Engine oil level sensor</li></ul></figure>"]]